e linked event."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-reveal-warning-walton","factId":"frankenstein-fact-warning","characterId":"frankenstein-char-walton","eventId":"frankenstein-event-86","note":"Learns or confirms this fact at the linked event."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-reveal-warning-victor","factId":"frankenstein-fact-warning","characterId":"frankenstein-char-victor","eventId":"frankenstein-event-86","note":"Learns or confirms this fact at the linked event."}],"characterGoals":[{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-goal-1","characterId":"frankenstein-char-walton","startEventId":"frankenstein-event-1","endEventId":"frankenstein-event-86","type":"want","text":"Reach the polar region without losing the expedition."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-goal-2","characterId":"frankenstein-char-victor","startEventId":"frankenstein-event-19","endEventId":"frankenstein-event-25","type":"want","text":"Discover the principle of life and create a living being."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-goal-3","characterId":"frankenstein-char-victor","startEventId":"frankenstein-event-26","endEventId":"frankenstein-event-43","type":"want","text":"Hide the creation and preserve ordinary family life."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-goal-4","characterId":"frankenstein-char-creature","startEventId":"frankenstein-event-29","endEventId":"frankenstein-event-42","type":"want","text":"Understand humanity and obtain recognition from his creator."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-goal-5","characterId":"frankenstein-char-creature","startEventId":"frankenstein-event-43","endEventId":"frankenstein-event-61","type":"want","text":"Earn or secure a companion who will not reject him."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-goal-6","characterId":"frankenstein-char-victor","startEventId":"frankenstein-event-61","endEventId":"frankenstein-event-71","type":"want","text":"Resolve the promise of a second creature without endangering humanity."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-goal-7","characterId":"frankenstein-char-creature","startEventId":"frankenstein-event-71","endEventId":"frankenstein-event-88","type":"want","text":"Destroy Victor’s attachments after the companion is denied."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-goal-8","characterId":"frankenstein-char-victor","startEventId":"frankenstein-event-83","endEventId":"frankenstein-event-87","type":"want","text":"Pursue and destroy the Creature."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-goal-9","characterId":"frankenstein-char-walton","startEventId":"frankenstein-event-86","endEventId":"frankenstein-event-88","type":"want","text":"Bring the crew safely home after abandoning the polar objective."}],"sceneTexts":[],"plotThreads":[{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-frame","name":"Walton’s Polar Expedition","color":"#6d9db5","description":"The Arctic frame tests whether Walton will repeat Victor’s destructive ambition."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-ambition","name":"Forbidden Ambition","color":"#a88150","description":"Knowledge pursued without ethical restraint links Walton and Victor."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-creation","name":"Creating Life","color":"#9d6f52","description":"Victor’s discovery, construction, and attempted repetition of animation."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-abandonment","name":"Abandonment and Responsibility","color":"#7a8c66","description":"The consequences of refusing care for a being one has made."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-education","name":"The Creature’s Education","color":"#8c7aa8","description":"Language, books, history, and observation awaken the Creature’s moral consciousness."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-family","name":"Domestic Affection","color":"#b88772","description":"Families and chosen bonds offer the belonging repeatedly destroyed by secrecy."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-justice","name":"Justice and False Judgment","color":"#866d62","description":"Institutions and individuals judge by appearances and incomplete evidence."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-companion","name":"The Promised Companion","color":"#9a6e89","description":"The demand, promise, construction, and destruction of a second creature."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-vengeance","name":"Cycle of Vengeance","color":"#9b4852","description":"Creature and creator answer injury with escalating retaliation."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-pursuit","name":"The Final Pursuit","color":"#637c8d","description":"Victor follows the Creature from Geneva toward the Arctic."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-isolation","name":"Isolation and Rejection","color":"#6f748c","description":"Loneliness distorts Walton, Victor, and the Creature in different ways."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-secrecy","name":"Victor’s Secret","color":"#887759","description":"Victor’s refusal to disclose the Creature repeatedly endangers others."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-nature","name":"Sublime Nature","color":"#668b7a","description":"Storms, mountains, lakes, and ice reflect or interrupt human passion."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-death","name":"The Ruined Family","color":"#75515a","description":"Each death narrows Victor’s world until vengeance is all that remains."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-travel","name":"The British Journey","color":"#78946c","description":"Victor and Clerval cross England and Scotland under opposite emotional conditions."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-responsibility","name":"The Ethics of Creation","color":"#8a6557","description":"Promises and decisions test responsibility toward existing and possible life."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-thread-ice","name":"Into the Ice","color":"#789db0","description":"Ice traps Walton, separates Victor from the Creature, and closes the pursuit."}],"motifs":[{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-motif-light","name":"Light and Fire","color":"#d49a45","description":"Discovery promises illumination but also pain and destruction."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-motif-ice","name":"Ice","color":"#8fb7c9","description":"Isolation, arrested movement, and the extremity of ambition."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-motif-books","name":"Books and Letters","color":"#a98b63","description":"Nested documents create knowledge while exposing its limits."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-motif-eyes","name":"Eyes and Appearance","color":"#9b8766","description":"Sight produces disgust and prejudice before speech can be heard."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-motif-double","name":"Creator and Double","color":"#846b91","description":"Victor and the Creature mirror one another’s isolation and revenge."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-motif-home","name":"Home and Hearth","color":"#b67b62","description":"Domestic shelter defines the happiness both Victor and the Creature lose."},{"worldId":"frankenstein-world","createdAt":1785528000000,"updatedAt":1785528000000,"id":"frankenstein-motif-nature","name":"Sublime Nature","color":"#5d8c77","description":"Landscape alternately heals, dwarfs, and threatens the characters."}],"continuitySuppressions":[],"writingLogs":[],"sceneRevisions":[]}